oxtuner-ui vendors the dock skin and the tab bar from gpui-component.

  Source: gpui-component 0.9.0 (https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit)
  Files:  src/dock/{mod,panel,tab_panel,dock,invalid_panel}.rs
          src/tabs/{mod,tab,tab_bar}.rs
  License: Apache License 2.0, see LICENSE-APACHE beside this file.

The files were adapted to this crate: imports point at the `gpui_kit`
re-exports instead of the gpui-component crate root, the crate's own module
paths (`crate::dock`, `crate::tabs`), the tab strip reads its variant and its
pick callback from the skin, and the chrome labels are plain strings because
the application owns translation. Everything else keeps its upstream shape so a
later upgrade can be compared against the release it came from.
